  "document": {
    "text": "Mira waited beside the dark lighthouse. The last boat had disappeared into the fog.\n\nA sharp knock struck the door. Mira jumped; behind the wood, her brother laughed at his own prank.\n\nHe placed their mother’s small lantern on the table. Its flame was only a memory now.\n\nTogether they opened the shutters. In the distance, the neighbours lit their lamps one by one.",
    "language": "en",
    "title": "The lantern returns",
