        "end": 83,
        "text": "Mira waited beside the dark lighthouse. The last boat had disappeared into the fog."
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "start": 85,
        "end": 183,
        "text": "A sharp knock struck the door. Mira jumped; behind the wood, her brother laughed at his own prank."
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "start": 185,
        "end": 270,
        "text": "He placed their mother’s small lantern on the table. Its flame was only a memory now."
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "start": 272,
        "end": 366,
        "text": "Together they opened the shutters. In the distance, the neighbours lit their lamps one by one."
      }
    ]
